# Walgreens shift sync (on demand)

**Invariant**: `operator_asks(sync_shifts ∨ new_reflexis ∨ run_walgreens_runbook) ⇒ execute(runbook:walgreens-sync-shift)` · `¬email_as_sot` · `¬schedule_unless_asked` · `¬pin_dated_roster_in_runbook`.

SOT body: `cortex://notes/runbooks/walgreens-sync-shift.md` · entity `runbook:walgreens-sync-shift`.
Roster authority = live ESS My Schedule only. Calendar is one-way reconcile (phone). Harvest JSON + Cortex events are projections, not a second roster.

## Order

`A(ESS→Cortex) ≺ B(Cortex→primary Calendar+Wake) ≺ C(dashboard bake)`.
Harvest SHA unchanged ⇒ skip B and C, report no-op.

