| Bad | Good |
|---|---|
| Reflexis mail as roster | Kick only; ESS My Schedule wins |
| Cowork scrape as Leg A | Jupiter scripts on `:9260` |
| Claim Clock alarm with no connector | `clock_connector=none` + Calendar popups |
| Invent Maps minutes on the dashboard | `—` or skip the new edge |
| Pin dated store/clock/wake rows in the runbook | Harvest JSON + wake **formula**; last bake is historical |
| Bake the dashboard from Calendar / old HTML / email | Remaining scheduled days from the **current** harvest |
| Install a cron because it might help | Schedule is a later ask; cost table is in the runbook |

